OL,3,GNEWSAUK 'supports Ukraine 100%',
OL,4,ABurnham says, after Russia's drone
OL,5,Awarning
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK Prime Minister Andy Burnham has said
OL,8,FLondon will continue "to support
OL,9,FUkraine 100%", after Moscow warned of
OL,10,F"consequences" following confirmation
OL,11,Fthat British-made drones were used in
OL,12,Frecent Ukrainian strikes in Russia.
OL,14,F"We are not fair-weather friends, we
OL,15,Fwill be there in Ukraine's hour of need
OL,16,Fand that won't change," he said.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
