OL,3,GNEWSAUK 'supports Ukraine 100%',
OL,4,ABurnham says, after Russia's drone
OL,5,Awarning
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Russian embassy in the UK earlier
OL,8,Faccused Britain of "deliberately opting
OL,9,Ffor an escalation of the Ukraine
OL,10,Fcrisis", saying "the deeper its
OL,11,Finvolvement in the conflict... the
OL,12,Fhigher the price it will pay".
OL,14,FKyiv has stepped up long-range attacks
OL,15,Fon Moscow and other Russian regions,
OL,16,Ftargeting oil refineries and warehouses
OL,17,Fof the largest online retailer
OL,18,FWildberries.
